         MT852-859 CONSTRAINED TO EQUAL MT4 VARIANCES, I.E.,       328 1451
         CONSISTENT WITH THOSE FROM THE (N,NT) V-C ANALYSIS.       328 1451
 MT=854  SINGLE LUMP OF MT=56 DETERMINED FROM SCATTER AND ERRORS   328 1451
