 MT=855  LUMP OF MT=57-61 DETERMINED AS DESCRIBED UNDER MT-853.    328 1451
 MT=856  LUMP OF MT=62-66 DETERMINED AS DESCRIBED UNDER MT-853.    328 1451
 MT=857  LUMP OF MT=67-71 DETERMINED AS DESCRIBED UNDER MT-853.    328 1451
